    "combo1": {
      "title": "Radiant Typhoon Vision into the Triple Engage! Kagari Loop",
      "description": "A spell-count opener that leans on Radiant Typhoon Vision to dig two cards deep and stock the Graveyard before the Sky Striker engine ever fires. Vision draws Ghost Ogre & Snow Rabbit plus a second Sky Striker Mobilize - Engage!, then Linkage! and Vision itself are sent to the Graveyard to turn the Spell/Trap Zone back on. The first Engage! searches, Raye is Normal Summoned and tributes herself for Sky Striker Ace = Zero, and a second Engage! adds Sky Striker Special Maneuver - Lemnisgate!. Linkage! then converts Zero into Sky Striker Ace - Kagari, who recycles Engage! from the Graveyard for a third activation. The turn ends on Kagari, a set Sky Striker Mecha - Widow Anchor, Lemnisgate! in hand and a Graveyard stacked with spells.",
      "date": "August 16, 2026",
      "credits": "✨ Replay by AFU ✨",
